sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Signed-in User
  participant F as :Frontend
  participant G as :Gems
  participant GDB as :Gems DB
  participant LF as :Live Feed
  participant OF as :Frontend (another user)

  U->>+F: open the dashboard
  F->>+G: GET /gem/newest?limit
  G->>+GDB: gems.find({}).sort({ createdAt: -1 }).limit(limit)
  GDB-->>-G: gems
  G-->>-F: 200 [gems]
  F-->>-U: the newest gems

  F-)LF: WebSocket /feed: { type: "subscribe", latitude, longitude, radius }
  alt location and radius valid
    LF-)F: { type: "subscribed", latitude, longitude, radius }
  else invalid
    LF-)F: { type: "error", message }
  end

  Note over OF,G: Another user adds a gem within the radius (Add a Gem)
  OF->>+G: POST /gem { name, latitude, longitude } + Bearer JWT
  G->>+GDB: gems.insertOne(gem)
  GDB-->>-G: inserted
  G->>+LF: publishGemAdded(gem)
  LF-)F: { type: "gem.added", gem }
  LF-->>-G: number of apps notified
  G-->>-OF: 201 gem
  F-)U: the new gem appears at the top of the list (no refresh)
  Note over F,LF: Rating a gem in the area sends { type: "gem.updated", gem } the same way
